@*
    Microbiology Report Entry (Reporting Type Template): behaviour of the Select (picklist) and narrative rows on the shared
    Lab Report Entry page. Loaded after the page script, and only on that screen.

    Every row keeps its value in the hidden .txt-test-val the page already works with (counts, Submit / Validate / Approve,
    edit unlock, re-collect / reject). The visible control - a picklist or a Quill editor - follows that input: when the page
    locks it (readonly), unlocks it, or disables it (sample re-collect / rejected), the control is locked, unlocked or cleared.
*@
<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/views/LabReporting/_LabReportingMixedTypeScripts.css" asp-append-version="true" />
<script src="~/js/views/LabReporting/_LabReportingMixedTypeScripts.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
